
<#
.SYNOPSIS
    This PowerShell script ensures that the Windows account
    lockout observation window is configured to at least
    15 minutes.

.NOTES
    Author          : Sinjin Torga-Eide
    LinkedIn        : https://www.linkedin.com/in/sinjin-torga-eide-674185297
    GitHub          : https://github.com/DatGuy84
    Date Created    : 2026-11-16
    Version         : 1.0
    CVEs            : N/A
    Plugin IDs      : N/A
    STIG-ID         : WN11-AC-000015
    Severity        : Medium (CAT II)
    Documentation   : https://stigaview.com/products/win11/v2r7/WN11-AC-000015/

.TESTED ON
    Date(s) Tested  : 2026-11-16
    Tested By       : Sinjin Torga-Eide
    Systems Tested  : Windows 11 VM 
    PowerShell Ver. : Not recorded

.USAGE
    Run PowerShell as Administrator.

    Example:
    PS C:\> .\WN11-AC-000015.ps1

    This script configures the account lockout observation
    window to 15 minutes and verifies the configuration.
#>

# STIG WN11-AC-000015 Remediation

# Configure account lockout observation window
net accounts /lockoutwindow:15

# Verify account lockout policy
net accounts
